5. VIEW TUTORIAL VIDEO ACTIVITY DIAGRAM
================================================================================

@startuml ViewTutorial
title View Tutorial Video - Simplified

|User|
start
:Buka Halaman Panduan;

|System|
:Load Daftar Video;

