SUMMARY
================================================================================

File ini berisi 9 SIMPLIFIED activity diagrams dalam format PlantUML.
Diagram sudah disederhanakan dengan fokus pada alur utama.

DAFTAR DIAGRAMS:
1. Login - Email/Password & Google OAuth
2. Register - Registrasi user baru
3. Manage Profile - Edit profil & change password
4. View RVM Location - Peta lokasi RVM
5. View Tutorial Video - Video panduan
6. View Points - Lihat saldo poin
7. View Transaction History - Riwayat transaksi
8. Redeem Reward - Tukar poin (E-wallet/Voucher/Pulsa)
9. Deposit Bottles - Scan QR & deposit botol real-time

SWIMLANES:
- User: Aktivitas pengguna
- System: Backend processing
- Arduino: IoT device detection
- Third-party: External services (Google, Payment Gateway)

CARA RENDER:
- Online: https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/uml/
- VS Code: Install extension "PlantUML"
- CLI: plantuml activity-diagram-plantuml.puml

Diagram sudah disederhanakan untuk kemudahan pemahaman.
Fokus pada happy path dan decision point utama.

